  "text": "Introduction - Library Home Resources E-resources Online Databases Online Journals E-Books Resources with Trial Access Open Access Resources Print Resources External E-Resources Services Outreach Services – English for Fun Circulation Inter Library Loans (ILL) Off-Campus Access to E-Resources Obtaining  ISBNs/ISSNs Laptop Lending Service Wi-Fi Facility Photocopying Service Opening Hours Palm-leaf Manuscript Reading Service Collections Downloads Media News Gallery About Introduction Branch Libraries Library Virtual Tour Library Layout Our Staff Academic Staff Non Academic Staff Help OPAC Search Advanced Search Account Help More Features FAQs Contacts Search for: Search Button Welcome to the Library!. University Web | FAQs +94 11 2804194 librarian@sjp.ac.lk +94 11 2758519 readerservices@sjp.ac.lk Library Catalogue +94 11 2804194 librarian@sjp.ac.lk +94 11 2758523 readerservices@sjp.ac.lk Library Catalogue Home Resources E-resources Online Databases Online Journals E-Books Resources with Trial Access Open Access Resources Print Resources External E-Resources Services Outreach Services – English for Fun Circulation Inter Library Loans (ILL) Off-Campus Access to E-Resources Obtaining  ISBNs/ISSNs Laptop Lending Service Wi-Fi Facility Photocopying Service Opening Hours Palm-leaf Manuscript Reading Service Collections Downloads Media News Gallery About Introduction Branch Libraries Library Virtual Tour Library Layout Our Staff Academic Staff Non Academic Staff Help OPAC Search Advanced Search Account Help More Features FAQs Contacts Search for: Search Button Introduction Home Introduction The library was commenced with an initial collection inherited from Vidyodaya Pirivena with establishment of the Vidyodaya University of Ceylon in 1959. Subsequently it was housed in a substantial area of the Sri Sumangala Building since 1961 and developed the collection over the years. The entire collection of the library was shifted to aspirate library building in 1988. It is certainly located with provision for a full-pledged library. The new building was designed to draw as much as natural light, ventilation and fresh air as possible into the complex, and to blend well with the surroundings. Opening Hours Inter Library Loans Research Support CONTACT INFO Librarian: Dr. (Mrs). Nayana Wijayasundara Library, University of Sri Jayewardenepura\r\nNugegoda, Sri Lanka. Tel: +94 11 2804194 Tel: +94 11 2758525 | Ext: 8525 Fax: +94 11 2804194 Email: librarian@sjp.ac.lk Web: www.lib.sjp.ac.lk LIBRARY NETWORK Library network of the University of Sri Jayewardenepura consists of Main Library and three branch libraries. Which are Medical Library located at the Medical Faculty, University Premises, Technology Library at the Technology Faculty, Pitipana and Engineering Library at the Engineering Faculty, Rathmalana. MAIN LIBRARY SERVICES Home News About Us Contact Us Inter Library Loans Home News About Us Contact Us Gallery Library Catalogue Library Office: Tel: +94 11 2758520, +94 11 2802696 Ext: 8520 Email: ar.library@sjp.ac.lk Inquiry Desk: Tel: +94 11 2758523, Ext: 8523 Email: readerservices@sjp.ac.lk Main Circulation Counter: Tel: +94 11 2758518, Ext: 8518 Inter Library Loans/DDS Email: illusjp@sjp.ac.lk Copyright @ Library, University of Sri Jayewardenepura. Designed by: Library IT Division web designers in sri lanka",
